---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import SearchOverlay from '../components/SearchOverlay.astro';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms of Service | SolversPro"
  description="Terms of Service for SolversPro."
>
  <Header />
  <SearchOverlay />
  
  <main class="flex-1 py-16 px-6">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-6">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mb-10">Effective Date: January 1, {year}</p>

      <div class="prose prose-lg text-zinc-400">
        <p>
          Welcome to SolversPro. By accessing and using this website, you accept and agree to be bound by the terms and provision of this agreement.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">1. Use of Our Tools</h2>
        <p>
          SolversPro provides a collection of free, browser-based calculators and utility tools. These tools are provided for informational and educational purposes only. While we strive to ensure the accuracy of our calculators, we cannot guarantee their absolute precision. 
        </p>
        <p>
          You should not rely solely on the results of these tools for critical financial, medical, or engineering decisions. Always consult with a qualified professional before making major decisions based on the calculations provided on this site.
        </p>
        <p>
          <strong>Artificial Intelligence Tools:</strong> Our Universal AI Solver utilizes third-party large language models to generate solutions. AI models can hallucinate or produce inaccurate, incomplete, or misleading information. You must independently verify any answers, code, or equations generated by the AI before using them in any professional or academic capacity.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">2. Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The content, layout, design, data, and graphics on this website are protected by intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, duplicate, or copy material from SolversPro without our explicit permission.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">3. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The materials and tools on SolversPro are provided "as is". SolversPro makes no warranties, expressed or implied, and hereby disclaims and negates all other warranties, including without limitation, implied warranties or conditions of merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, or non-infringement of intellectual property or other violation of rights.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">4. Limitations of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          In no event shall SolversPro or its creators be liable for any damages (including, without limitation, damages for loss of data or profit, or due to business interruption) arising out of the use or inability to use the tools on SolversPro, even if we have been notified orally or in writing of the possibility of such damage.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">5. Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          Any claim relating to SolversPro shall be governed by the laws of the applicable jurisdiction without regard to its conflict of law provisions.
        </p>

        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-8 mb-4">6. Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have any questions about these Terms, please contact us via our <a href="/contact" class="text-[#2dd4bf] hover:underline">Contact Page</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
  
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
